🕸️ Crawl — Multiple Pages
 
 POST /crawl  — Start bulk crawl; returns job ID
 
Request:
 
json
  
{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "maxDepth": 3,
  "limit": 100,
  "scrapeOptions": { "formats": ["markdown"] },
  "allowExternalLinks": false,
  "includePaths": ["/docs/*"],
  "excludePaths": ["/blog/*"]
}
 
 
Response:
 
json
  
{
  "success": true,
  "id": "crawl_abc123",
  "url": "https://api.firecrawl.dev/v2/crawl/abc123"
}
 
 
