🗺️ Map — Site Structure
 
 POST /map  — Get all URLs on domain (fast, no full scrape)
 
Request:
 
json
  
{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "search": "query",
  "includeSubdomains": false,
  "limit": 5000
}
 
 
Response:
 
json
  
{
  "success": true,
  "links": [
    "https://example.com/",
    "https://example.com/about",
    "https://example.com/docs"
  ]
}
 
 
🧠 Extract — Structured Data
 
 POST /extract  — AI-powered JSON extraction 
 
Request:
 
json
  
{
  "urls": ["https://example.com/products"],
  "schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "products": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "name": "string",
          "price": "number",
          "inStock": "boolean"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "prompt": "Extract all product info"
}
 
 
Response:
 
json
  
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { "products": [...] }
}
 
 
