⚙️ Browser Actions (Scrape/Crawl)
 
Use  actions  array to automate pages: 
 
Action Params Purpose 
 wait   ms ,  selector  Wait time or element 
 click   selector ,  all?  Click element(s) 
 write   text  Type into focused field 
 press   key  Press key (Enter/Tab) 
 scroll   direction ,  selector?  Scroll page/element 
 screenshot   fullPage? ,  quality?  Capture screenshot 
 executeJavascript   script  Run custom JS 
 pdf   format ,  landscape  Generate PDF 
 
 
 
📊 Rate Limits & Errors
 
Status Codes
 
- 200 OK: Success
- 401 Unauthorized: Invalid/missing API key
- 402 Payment Required: Insufficient credits
- 429 Too Many Requests: Rate limit exceeded
- 500/502/503: Server/upstream errors
 
Limits
 
- Rate: ~100–200 req/min
- Crawl: Max 10k–100k pages/job (depends on plan)
- Size: Page content up to ~10MB
- Credits: 1 credit = 1 page scrape; crawl = 1 credit/page
 
 
 
